    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>geodesic-pairs-pairs · 1×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 64 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-geodesic-pairs-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-geodesic-pairs-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAABlBMVEVfZnLZ2dmiVvOOAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAW4AGSvqp2EAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const originsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; origins: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const targetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; targets: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const distancesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; distances: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const initialBearingsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; initialBearings: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const midpointsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; midpoints: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const convergedOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; converged: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const GEODESIC_PI: f32 = 3.14159265358979;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS: f32 = 0.0174532925199433;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES: f32 = 57.2957795130823;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(delta: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  return delta - 360.0 * round(delta / 360.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">// cos(latitude) as sin(colatitude): 90 - |lat| is exact in f32, so the cosine keeps its relative\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">// precision near the poles where cos(lat * pi / 180) would not.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">fn geodesicCosLatitude(latitudeDegrees: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  return sin((90.0 - abs(latitudeDegrees)) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">fn geodesicUnitVector(lngLat: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec3&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  let lambda = lngLat.x * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let phi = lngLat.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  let cosPhi = geodesicCosLatitude(lngLat.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(cosPhi * cos(lambda), cosPhi * sin(lambda), sin(phi));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">fn geodesicFromUnitVector(vector: vec3&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  let horizontal = sqrt(vector.x * vector.x + vector.y * vector.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">    atan2(vector.y, vector.x) * GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">    atan2(vector.z, horizontal) * GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">fn geodesicHaversineTerm(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let deltaPhi = (b.y - a.y) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let deltaLambda = geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(b.x - a.x) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let sinHalfPhi = sin(0.5 * deltaPhi);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let sinHalfLambda = sin(0.5 * deltaLambda);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let term = sinHalfPhi * sinHalfPhi +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">    geodesicCosLatitude(a.y) * geodesicCosLatitude(b.y) *\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    sinHalfLambda * sinHalfLambda;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  return clamp(term, 0.0, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">fn geodesicCentralAngle(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  // Vincenty&#39;s special case for the sphere: well conditioned from a millimeter to antipodal,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  // unlike the haversine form whose sqrt(1 - h) loses precision near antipodes.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  let phi1 = a.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  let phi2 = b.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let deltaPhi = (b.y - a.y) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  let deltaLambda = geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(b.x - a.x) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  let sinPhi1 = sin(phi1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  let cosPhi1 = geodesicCosLatitude(a.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  let cosPhi2 = geodesicCosLatitude(b.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  let sinHalfLambda = sin(0.5 * deltaLambda);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  let halfVersine = 2.0 * sinHalfLambda * sinHalfLambda;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  let east = cosPhi2 * sin(deltaLambda);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let north = sin(deltaPhi) + sinPhi1 * cosPhi2 * halfVersine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let up = sinPhi1 * sin(phi2) + cosPhi1 * cosPhi2 * (1.0 - halfVersine);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  return atan2(sqrt(east * east + north * north), up);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">fn geodesicInitialBearingDegrees(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let phi1 = a.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  let phi2 = b.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let deltaPhi = (b.y - a.y) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let deltaLambda = geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(b.x - a.x) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  let sinHalfLambda = sin(0.5 * deltaLambda);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let cosPhi2 = geodesicCosLatitude(b.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  let y = sin(deltaLambda) * cosPhi2;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  // cos(phi1) sin(phi2) - sin(phi1) cos(phi2) cos(deltaLambda), without cancellation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  let x = sin(deltaPhi) + 2.0 * sin(phi1) * cosPhi2 * sinHalfLambda * sinHalfLambda;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  return atan2(y, x) * GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">fn geodesicDestination(origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, bearingDegrees: f32, angle: f32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  let phi1 = origin.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let theta = bearingDegrees * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  let sinPhi1 = sin(phi1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  let cosPhi1 = geodesicCosLatitude(origin.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  let sinHalfAngle = sin(0.5 * angle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  // sin(phi2) - sin(phi1), from the half-angle form so short moves keep their precision.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  let sinDelta = -2.0 * sinPhi1 * sinHalfAngle * sinHalfAngle + cosPhi1 * sin(angle) * cos(theta);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  let sinPhi2 = clamp(sinPhi1 + sinDelta, -1.0, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  let roughPhi2 = asin(sinPhi2);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  // sin(phi2) - sin(phi1) = 2 cos((phi1 + phi2) / 2) sin((phi2 - phi1) / 2); the midpoint cosine\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  // is insensitive to the rough phi2, so the latitude change is recovered to relative precision.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  let midpointCosine = cos(0.5 * (phi1 + roughPhi2));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  var deltaPhi = roughPhi2 - phi1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  if (abs(midpointCosine) &gt; 1e-3) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">    deltaPhi = 2.0 * asin(clamp(sinDelta / (2.0 * midpointCosine), -1.0, 1.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  let deltaLambda = atan2(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">    sin(theta) * sin(angle) * cosPhi1,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">    cos(angle) - sinPhi1 * sinPhi2\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">    origin.x + deltaLambda * GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">    origin.y + deltaPhi * GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">fn geodesicInterpolate(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, angle: f32, fraction: f32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  let unitA = geodesicUnitVector(a);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  let unitB = geodesicUnitVector(b);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  var vector: vec3&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  if (angle &lt; 1e-6) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">    vector = normalize(mix(unitA, unitB, fraction));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">    let sinAngle = sin(angle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    vector = unitA * (sin((1.0 - fraction) * angle) / sinAngle) +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">      unitB * (sin(fraction * angle) / sinAngle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  let lngLat = geodesicFromUnitVector(vector);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  // Keep longitudes continuous with the start point (unwrapped across the antimeridian).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(a.x + geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(lngLat.x - a.x), lngLat.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">fn geodesicSinLatitudeDelta(latitudeDegrees: f32, originLatitudeDegrees: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  let halfSum = 0.5 * (latitudeDegrees + originLatitudeDegrees) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  let halfDifference = 0.5 * (latitudeDegrees - originLatitudeDegrees) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  return 2.0 * cos(halfSum) * sin(halfDifference);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">fn geodesicHaversineDistance(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, radius: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">  return radius * geodesicCentralAngle(a, b);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">// Offset of position from origin in the local equirectangular frame at origin, in degrees of\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">// latitude (east offsets scaled by cos(latitude of origin), longitudes wrapped at +-180).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">fn geodesicLocalOffset(origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, position: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">    geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(position.x - origin.x) * geodesicCosLatitude(origin.y),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">    position.y - origin.y\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">// Fraction in [0, 1] of the point of segment start-end closest to point, in the local\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">// equirectangular frame at point: exact to first order for segments of road length.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">fn geodesicSegmentFraction(point: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, start: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, end: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  let startOffset = geodesicLocalOffset(point, start);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">  let segment = geodesicLocalOffset(point, end) - startOffset;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">  let denominator = dot(segment, segment);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  if (denominator &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">    return clamp(-dot(startOffset, segment) / denominator, 0.0, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">// Great-circle distance (units of radius) from point to the position at fraction along the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">// segment, built from coordinate differences so short distances keep their precision near +-180.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">fn geodesicSegmentDistance(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">  point: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">  start: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">  end: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"169\">  fraction: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"170\">  radius: f32\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"171\">) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"172\">  let startOffset = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(start.x - point.x), start.y - point.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"173\">  let delta = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(end.x - start.x), end.y - start.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"174\">  let offset = startOffset + fraction * delta;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"175\">  let sinHalfLatitude = sin(0.5 * offset.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"176\">  let sinHalfLongitude = sin(0.5 * offset.x * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"177\">  let term = sinHalfLatitude * sinHalfLatitude +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"178\">    geodesicCosLatitude(point.y) * geodesicCosLatitude(point.y + offset.y) *\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"179\">    sinHalfLongitude * sinHalfLongitude;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"180\">  return 2.0 * radius * asin(sqrt(clamp(term, 0.0, 1.0)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"181\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"182\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"183\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"184\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"185\">struct VincentyInverse {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"186\">  distance: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"187\">  initialBearing: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"188\">  finalBearing: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"189\">  converged: bool,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"190\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"191\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"192\">struct VincentyDirect {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"193\">  destination: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"194\">  finalBearing: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"195\">  converged: bool,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"196\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"197\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"198\">const VINCENTY_A: f32 = 6378137.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"199\">const VINCENTY_B: f32 = 6356752.5;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"200\">const VINCENTY_F: f32 = 0.0033528106287121773;\n</span></code></pre><p>211 source lines omitted</p><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>origins<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"origins\">origins</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>targets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"targets\">targets</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>distances<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"distances\">distances</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>initialBearings<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"initialBearings\">initialBearings</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>midpoints<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata